The item store's verbs moved to `booping items`: `booping specs open-items` is an unknown
verb of `specs`, rejected by argparse with its usage line and exit 2.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- cmd --
booping specs open-items list
-- exit --
2
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
usage: booping specs [-h] <verb> ...
booping specs: error: argument <verb>: invalid choice: 'open-items' (choose from ls, next, check, init, site)
